{"id": "DdKA61hvQKJ", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"FABLE\" to get the leaked Claude Fable 5.1 system prompt.\n\nSomeone just leaked the full system prompt of Claude Fable 5.1.\n\nAnd this isn't some basic prompt.\n\nIt's over 275,000 characters long, around 8,000 lines.\n\nIt covers the exact instructions Anthropic uses to control how one of the world's most powerful AI models thinks, plans, and gets work done.\n\nThe leak includes the entire prompt with its tools, instructions, and behavior rules.\n\nAnd it's all sitting in public on GitHub right now.\n\nSo you can use it to improve your own prompting skills.\n\nBy studying exactly how Anthropic defines its tools.\n\nHow they set their restrictions.\n\nAnd how they tell the model what to use, when, and how.\n\nThink of it like getting the actual internal manual instead of just guessing how the system behaves from the outside.\n\nMost people prompt by trial and error, testing what works and hoping it holds up.\n\nThis lets you study the real structure behind one of the most capable models out there.\n\n#claudefable5 #systemprompt #aiprompting #githubrepo #claudeai", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1789150037, "like_count": 3802, "comment_count": 7119, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-989017204226138a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 61.833, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMfZn0O5030ucWJ_sEBk2S1IrLfJAz-cPIsNVqP_-cOOrBVaXLYjq2q9DxfuIBEFV8rnIQfM7iyipVGscFLJL35ZEc_9nMft1Ol46Y.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=Ado8DR_34QGs16FLtyid7yXdrPXEbp2NmGbCPlmyYYODHKfrz9a2pqsnKgaRu7mXu2g&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=UKbcRX4RpEEQ7kNvwFz6p5h&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=MvQSyo5dfTX8URzGQdm52w&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=